# skip-intro.keys — headless front-end progression, refined empirically.
# One step: WAIT, then the KEYS tail of a single AUTOTYPE command. Commas
# are AUTOTYPE pause tokens (2*pace = 0.2 s each at the default 0.1 s
# pace) and pace key events: AUTOTYPE commands are serialized by a host
# thread, so only the LAST line types while the game is live.
# Sequence: enter skips the looping intro (~10 s), then spaced space/enter
# presses walk the title screen into the MOD5 front-end module.
